1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,973
But the two glycolysis NADH must be shuttled into the mitochondrion.

2
00:00:04,973 --> 00:00:10,807
The malate aspartate shuttle keeps them at two point five each: thirty-two.

3
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:15,989
The glycerol phosphate shuttle drops them to one point five: thirty.

4
00:00:15,989 --> 00:00:19,140
So, thirty to thirty-two ATP.

